OL,3,GNEWSAProtestors who sprayed paint on
OL,4,ARadcliffe Camera sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo activists from the group Just Stop
OL,7,FOil have received suspended prison
OL,8,Fsentences for covering an iconic
OL,9,FUniversity of Oxford building with
OL,10,Fpaint.
OL,12,FDaniel Knorr and Noah Crane were
OL,13,Farrested in October 2023 after the
OL,14,FRadcliffe Camera was painted orange
OL,15,Fduring a protest.
OL,17,FFollowing a trial this week, Knorr, 24,
OL,18,Fwas found guilty of criminal damage to
OL,19,Fproperty valued under #5,000 and having
OL,20,Fan article with intent to destroy or
OL,21,Fdamage property. Crane, 21, previously
OL,22,Fplead guilty to the same offences.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
