OL,3,GNEWSAProtestors who sprayed paint on
OL,4,ARadcliffe Camera sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FKnorr was given a 20-week sentence,
OL,7,Fsuspended for two years, while Crane
OL,8,Freceived 16 weeks, also suspended for
OL,9,Ftwo years.
